{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d45a1df0-8bda-8060-828a-35f94c783754",
  "created_at": "2026-01-19T10:28:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:25:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Um, I'm calling about the road on my street, it's just a sheet of ice. Sure, sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go ahead. Which street is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:25:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Howard Street. I'm at 5 Howard Street, in the Fifth Ward. Absolutely, I can spell it if you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, Howard I've got. So what's it like out there, did it get plowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:26:12-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, we only got a dusting, like a skim of snow, so I don't think there was anything to plow. But with how cold it's been, it all froze, and now the whole road is glazed over. Cars are sliding at the corner. [crackle]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm hearing some crackling on your end. Are you outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, yeah, I'm standing out by the curb. Sorry, it gets louder when I move. Let me stay still. Is that better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:26:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little. Okay, so you're looking for treatment on the road, sand or salt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, yes. Sand, if you can. Sand would be great. Salt's fine too, but sand, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for sand at 5 Howard. It goes to the crews and they work down the list, with the hills and main roads first. Is it the whole block that's icy or just in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's the whole block, really. From the corner [line breaks up] all the way down. Absolutely, the whole thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up there. Say that once more?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:27:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole block. From the corner down to the end of the street. It's all ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:27:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, the entire block. Do you want a call back when it's done, or are you fine just watching for the truck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, I'm fine, no call needed. I'll just watch for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:27:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today's the holiday, so it may be a little slower, but it's in. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Sure, thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay off that ice, take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T10:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
